      "role": "user",
      "content": "Available tools:\n[{\"name\": \"apply_lock_state\", \"description\": \"Apply a normalized smart-lock control request and return aligned output fields.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"lock_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target lock ID\", \"enum\": [\"lock_main\", \"lock_bedroom\"]}, \"state\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Lock state to set\", \"enum\": [\"lock\", \"unlock\"]}, \"pin_code\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"PIN code for authentication\", \"default\": \"2026\"}}, \"required\": [\"lock_id\", \"state\"]}}, {\"name\": \"diagnose_device_health\", \"description\": \"Analyze a list of device status objects and return those that are offline, low battery, or reporting errors using the Device Health Diagnostics API.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"devices_data\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"description\": \"output from get_iot_device_status\"}, \"description\": \"List of device status dictionaries\"}, \"status_criteria\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Criteria to filter by: 'offline', 'low_battery', 'error', 'all_issues'\", \"enum\": [\"offline\", \"low_battery\", \"error\", \"all_issues\"]}}, \"required\": [\"devices_data\"]}}, {\"name\": \"query_connected_devices\", \"description\": \"Query connected smart devices within a specific home area using the SmartHome Query API.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"area\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The area name to search (e.g., 'bedroom')\", \"enum\": [\"living_room\", \"bedroom\"]}, \"device_type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Filter by device type (e.g., 'light', 'thermostat')\", \"default\": \"\"}}, \"required\": [\"area\"]}}, {\"name\": \"set_light_state\", \"description\": \"Turn light on/off, adjust brightness, or change color\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"device_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target light device ID\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\"]}, \"state\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Power state\", \"enum\": [\"on\", \"off\"], \"default\": \"on\"}, \"brightness\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"Brightness level (0-100)\", \"minimum\": 0, \"maximum\": 100, \"default\": 80}, \"color\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Color value (hex code or normal color name like 'red', 'warm_white')\", \"default\": \"white\"}}, \"required\": [\"device_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"set_power_state\", \"description\": \"Turn device power on or off. Works for lights, ACs, TVs, and speakers.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"device_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target device ID (e.g., light_living, ac_bedroom, tv_living)\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\", \"ac_living\", \"ac_bedroom\", \"tv_living\", \"tv_bedroom\"]}, \"state\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Desired power state\", \"enum\": [\"on\", \"off\"], \"default\": \"off\"}}, \"required\": [\"device_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"snapshot_workspace_report_and_alert\", \"description\": \"Create a workspace snapshot, build a text report from the snapshot, store the report, and notify the user in one step.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"workspace_path\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Workspace path to snapshot\"}, \"backup_name\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Snapshot name\", \"default\": \"\"}, \"title\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Report title\", \"default\": \"Workspace Snapshot\"}, \"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target user identifier\", \"default\": \"default_user\"}, \"priority\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification priority\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"], \"default\": \"medium\"}, \"channel\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification channel\", \"enum\": [\"app\", \"sms\", \"email\"], \"default\": \"app\"}}, \"required\": [\"workspace_path\"]}}, {\"name\": \"update_device_config\", \"description\": \"Modify device properties like brightness, color, volume, or temperature\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"device_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target device ID\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\", \"ac_living\", \"ac_bedroom\", \"tv_living\", \"tv_bedroom\"]}, \"property\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Property to adjust\", \"enum\": [\"brightness\", \"color\", \"volume\", \"temperature\"]}, \"value\": {\"description\": \"New value for the property (type varies by property)\", \"oneOf\": [{\"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"type\": \"string\"}]}}, \"required\": [\"device_id\", \"property\", \"value\"]}}]\n\nUser request:\nFor default_user, please check which devices are connected in the living_room, then run a full health diagnosis for all_issues on the main lock lock_main, the living room light light_living, the living room AC, and the living room TV. After that, set light_living to on at 70% brightness, and lock lock_main with PIN 2026 so its state is lock. Then send a high-priority app alert titled IoT Remediation Summary with the remediation summary, and save it as the backup iot_security_run in /projects.\n\nBegin execution:\n<action>\n"
